Further to our meeting, here is the tiered custody fee for the Ardmore accounts, effective 1 December 2024.

  Month-end assets under custody of 400 million SGD or more: 6.0 basis points a year
  Month-end assets under custody below 400 million SGD: 9.5 basis points a year

The rate for a month is set by the assets under custody at the end of the previous month, and applies to all assets held in that month (it is not a banded rate). The fee accrues daily on a 365 day basis and is invoiced monthly in arrears in SGD. The tier is reviewed every month; we do not send a notice when the tier changes, it is shown on the invoice and the daily accrual statement.

Please let me know if you would like to discuss the schedule.

